WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.500
A long exposure.

00:02.200 --> 00:06.409
Stretch a long exposure further and the faintest outer parts appear.

00:06.859 --> 00:12.188
Every picture on this trip is a real photograph, placed where it is in the sky.

00:12.638 --> 00:15.509
The line below each one says who took it.
